*Make ManualRefill idempotent and awaitable; prevent overlapping Refill runs*

Calling StartCoroutine(Refill()) from both Update() and here can run Refill concurrently, causing duplicate spawns, inconsistent _uniques, and flapping HasSpawnedBackupNuke. Also, callers can’t wait for completion.

